He's gotta make some changes, right?

280
00:13:56,780 --> 00:13:57,780
I...

281
00:13:59,640 --> 00:14:00,370
Wan,

282
00:14:01,880 --> 00:14:02,880
I want to talk to you for a moment.

283
00:14:10,240 --> 00:14:11,860
Go talk it over.

284
00:14:12,330 --> 00:14:13,190
Let bygones

285
00:14:13,210 --> 00:14:14,670
be bygones.

286
00:14:14,690 --> 00:14:16,780
It's better to begin again
and do it the right way.

287
00:14:16,800 --> 00:14:18,170
Live in the present, yeah?

288
00:14:22,690 --> 00:14:24,840
Thank you for
bringing Wan back to me, Cher.

289
00:14:27,140 --> 00:14:28,250
Are you gonna take long, Third?

290
00:14:28,480 --> 00:14:29,840
I've gotta rush
to take care of some work.

291
00:14:30,400 --> 00:14:31,680
Feel free to head out.

292
00:14:32,340 --> 00:14:33,370
I'll give him a ride.

293
00:14:34,490 --> 00:14:36,300
Let Third drop you off.
I'll get going now.

294
00:14:37,780 --> 00:14:38,680
Cher...

295
00:14:40,070 --> 00:14:41,060
It's fine.

296
00:14:41,080 --> 00:14:42,560
You never had
a problem with it back then.

297
00:14:42,880 --> 00:14:44,080
I'm allowing it this time.

298
00:14:45,200 --> 00:14:45,880
Go.

299
00:14:46,390 --> 00:14:47,750
Acting like it's so impossible

300
00:14:47,770 --> 00:14:49,050
after you pulled
a fast one on me back then.

301
00:14:49,070 --> 00:14:50,070
I was almost in deep shit!

302
00:15:25,560 --> 00:15:27,150
I'm glad you came today.

303
00:15:32,820 --> 00:15:34,790
I'm glad to see you, too.

304
00:15:38,300 --> 00:15:39,360
You know?

305
00:15:39,950 --> 00:15:40,500
Last night...

306
00:15:40,520 --> 00:15:41,910
before the audition,

307
00:15:43,020 --> 00:15:45,080
I thought about the first day we met.

308
00:15:47,320 --> 00:15:48,500
Send in the guards, please.

309
00:15:49,320 --> 00:15:51,000
There's a stalking sasaeng in here.

310
00:15:51,320 --> 00:15:52,370
A hidden gem!

311
00:15:53,520 --> 00:15:56,340
I thought about the day
I stumbled into that audition

312
00:15:56,360 --> 00:15:57,580
because I met Cher.

313
00:15:58,910 --> 00:16:01,000
That was how I met you again.

314
00:16:01,100 --> 00:16:02,170
"Huh... Is this

315
00:16:02,190 --> 00:16:04,010
the promising young shark
Coach praises so much?"

316
00:16:04,030 --> 00:16:05,040
Terrible.

317
00:16:05,950 --> 00:16:07,120
Show me how it's done,

318
00:16:07,140 --> 00:16:08,080
since you're so good.

319
00:16:08,370 --> 00:16:10,720
From what I've seen
in the series, you're not all that.

320
00:16:12,160 --> 00:16:13,360
Watch your behavior, though,

321
00:16:13,610 --> 00:16:16,000
or people will call you
a "stalking sasaeng."

322
00:16:16,350 --> 00:16:17,760
Even though you insulted me so much

323
00:16:18,260 --> 00:16:19,810
that my blood boiled,

324
00:16:20,110 --> 00:16:21,320
and that I felt so suffocated

325
00:16:21,900 --> 00:16:23,610
that you had to come to my rescue,

326
00:16:24,910 --> 00:16:27,030
that improv technique of yours

327
00:16:27,370 --> 00:16:28,670
was how I made the cut.

328
00:16:28,690 --> 00:16:30,560
Shit, you made the cut?!

329
00:16:31,040 --> 00:16:32,800
[Ashawin Kosonkasem]
[Artist]

330
00:16:33,350 --> 00:16:34,470
Because of you...

331
00:16:35,170 --> 00:16:36,920
I paid off my parents' debt.

332
00:16:37,400 --> 00:16:38,900
As long as I pay it off for Mom,

333
00:16:38,920 --> 00:16:40,040
I'm happy.

334
00:16:41,130 --> 00:16:42,160
Because of you...

335
00:16:43,120 --> 00:16:45,120
I got into the entertainment industry.

336
00:16:48,450 --> 00:16:49,160
Cut!

337
00:16:49,820 --> 00:16:51,820
Wan, it's been so many takes,

338
00:16:51,840 --> 00:16:53,280
and none of them worked!

339
00:16:53,560 --> 00:16:56,540
Even though my ABCs of acting
started from nothing...

340
00:16:56,560 --> 00:16:57,800
You haven't got a clue!

341
00:16:58,190 --> 00:17:00,400
Do you suppose
we're ever gonna understand Sky?

342
00:17:00,720 --> 00:17:01,800
But because of you,

343
00:17:02,320 --> 00:17:04,220
you taught me to understand the emotions

344
00:17:04,560 --> 00:17:06,210
and feelings of the character.

345
00:17:07,819 --> 00:17:08,800
Only look at me.

346
00:17:10,319 --> 00:17:11,310
Only listen to me.

347
00:17:12,400 --> 00:17:13,400
Stay with me.

348
00:17:15,900 --> 00:17:16,980
You did amazingly today.

349
00:17:18,079 --> 00:17:19,800
Are you seriously complimenting me?

350
00:17:20,680 --> 00:17:22,119
And most importantly,

351
00:17:22,900 --> 00:17:25,319
you taught me
to understand my own feelings

352
00:17:26,660 --> 00:17:28,560
and how it feels to be loved.

353
00:17:36,870 --> 00:17:39,520
I don't know exactly
when we fell for each other,

354
00:17:40,080 --> 00:17:41,760
but before I realized it,

355
00:17:43,090 --> 00:17:44,720
you were already a part of my life.

356
00:17:45,200 --> 00:17:45,880
Wan.

357
00:17:46,570 --> 00:17:47,880
Do you trust your man, Wan?

358
00:17:48,760 --> 00:17:50,920
Of course, your boy trusts you.

359
00:17:51,350 --> 00:17:52,360
What are you drawing?

360
00:17:52,530 --> 00:17:53,440
An elephant.

361
00:17:53,780 --> 00:17:55,440
But you're even cuter.

362
00:17:56,390 --> 00:17:57,400
You like being with me, huh?

363
00:17:58,700 --> 00:17:59,880
I think so.

364
00:18:02,510 --> 00:18:03,510
Despite the grueling situations

365
00:18:03,540 --> 00:18:05,920
along the way,

366
00:18:06,930 --> 00:18:08,440
we came through.

367
00:18:17,150 --> 00:18:18,760
I give up.

368
00:18:19,370 --> 00:18:20,600
Wut...

369
00:18:21,250 --> 00:18:24,160
Still, so many people were left with scars.

370
00:18:26,000 --> 00:18:27,470
Falling from where I am might hurt,

371
00:18:28,590 --> 00:18:29,920
but I won't be embarrassed.

372
00:18:30,030 --> 00:18:31,280
Please don't go, Nine.

373
00:18:31,690 --> 00:18:32,320
Nine!

374
00:18:32,450 --> 00:18:32,950
Nine, baby!!

375
00:18:32,970 --> 00:18:33,580
Wan!

376
00:18:33,600 --> 00:18:34,170
Grab him.

377
00:18:34,190 --> 00:18:35,240
I'm sorry.

378
00:18:35,620 --> 00:18:38,280
I should've cared more about you guys.

379
00:18:39,200 --> 00:18:41,180
Including you and me

380
00:18:41,920 --> 00:18:43,800
who also needed time to heal.

381
00:18:44,720 --> 00:18:45,830
Let's break up.

382
00:18:46,830 --> 00:18:48,100
Don't leave, please?

383
00:18:48,120 --> 00:18:49,340
Stay with me.

384
00:18:49,360 --> 00:18:52,760
I hope you get to chase your dream
with all you've got.

385
00:18:54,670 --> 00:18:56,600
No, Wan.

386
00:18:56,890 --> 00:18:57,660
Wan...

387
00:18:58,260 --> 00:18:58,960
Wan...

388
00:19:00,430 --> 00:19:02,280
After all this time,

389
00:19:02,410 --> 00:19:04,920
I have reflected on
every single one of my thoughts.

390
00:19:05,920 --> 00:19:08,760
It made me understand my own feelings.

391
00:19:09,940 --> 00:19:12,000
No matter how long
the world keeps spinning,

392
00:19:13,200 --> 00:19:15,960
my feelings for you...

393
00:19:18,020 --> 00:19:19,640
stay the same.

394
00:19:38,710 --> 00:19:40,720
Can we start over?

395
00:19:51,170 --> 00:19:52,380
But I'm a sasaeng.

396
00:19:58,580 --> 00:20:00,180
I won't call the guards on you this time.

397
00:20:28,370 --> 00:20:30,170
And I will hold you tight.

398
00:20:33,480 --> 00:20:35,200
I won't ever let you run from me again.

399
00:20:43,420 --> 00:20:44,600
I'm sorry

400
00:20:46,860 --> 00:20:48,330
for everything.

401
00:21:19,610 --> 00:21:21,320
I'm sorry, too,

402
00:21:22,800 --> 00:21:24,320
that I only thought about myself.

403
00:21:25,760 --> 00:21:26,590
I...

404
00:21:26,610 --> 00:21:27,750
didn't even love myself.

405
00:21:30,070 --> 00:21:32,480
I put you through so much
and then walked away from you.

406
00:21:40,480 --> 00:21:41,400
Wan.

407
00:21:46,440 --> 00:21:47,820
I love you, Wan.

408
00:21:54,170 --> 00:21:55,920
I want to see you.

409
00:21:58,460 --> 00:21:59,670
I want to be with you.

410
00:22:03,760 --> 00:22:05,180
I want to be possessive of you.

411
00:22:05,200 --> 00:22:06,380
I want to get jealous over you.

412
00:22:08,770 --> 00:22:10,120
I want to worry about you.

413
00:22:20,120 --> 00:22:21,600
Let me win your heart again, please?

414
00:22:23,060 --> 00:22:23,880
Please?

415
00:23:00,480 --> 00:23:01,520
Winning my heart

416
00:23:03,690 --> 00:23:04,750
isn't easy.

417
00:23:14,370 --> 00:23:15,080
Sure.

418
00:23:18,270 --> 00:23:19,770
I'll keep on...

419
00:23:21,010 --> 00:23:22,040
flirting.

420
00:23:22,990 --> 00:23:25,000
Don't try to avoid me

421
00:23:25,020 --> 00:23:27,960
'cause I won't stop

422
00:23:28,460 --> 00:23:30,720
till you fall for me.

423
00:23:31,620 --> 00:23:34,360
I'll keep on flirting.

424
00:23:34,960 --> 00:23:36,800
I won't stop, I guarantee.

425
00:23:37,260 --> 00:23:40,480
I'll love you hard.

426
00:23:46,870 --> 00:23:51,280
♫And once you say yes, I'll set you free♫

427
00:23:59,390 --> 00:24:00,390
So delusional.

428
00:24:03,170 --> 00:24:04,170
Do you like it, though?

429
00:24:07,900 --> 00:24:09,520
I freaking love it.

430
00:24:57,110 --> 00:24:57,990
What would happen

431
00:24:58,010 --> 00:25:00,120
if I woke up and found out
that this was all a dream?

432
00:25:01,160 --> 00:25:02,440
It's time to wake up, then.

433
00:25:02,590 --> 00:25:03,440
Huh?!

434
00:25:04,420 --> 00:25:05,600
Am I dreaming?

435
00:25:06,200 --> 00:25:07,340
No, no, no, no,

436
00:25:07,360 --> 00:25:08,920
I'm not waking up.

437
00:25:09,420 --> 00:25:10,700
I'm gonna ask to hold you first.

438
00:25:10,820 --> 00:25:12,120
Let me hold you first...

439
00:25:15,760 --> 00:25:17,960
I think I should head home.
It's getting late.

440
00:25:18,590 --> 00:25:19,850
Hey, wait!

441
00:25:19,870 --> 00:25:21,030
Are you leaving already?

442
00:25:21,130 --> 00:25:22,150
Can you stay?

443
00:25:22,170 --> 00:25:23,410
I still want to spend time with you...

444
00:25:23,430 --> 00:25:24,470
No!

445
00:25:24,490 --> 00:25:25,560
Please?

446
00:25:28,650 --> 00:25:29,440
Please?

447
00:25:31,550 --> 00:25:33,800
Please, please?

448
00:25:53,690 --> 00:25:55,740
More, more, more.

449
00:25:55,760 --> 00:25:57,160
That's already too much.

450
00:25:57,450 --> 00:25:58,470
Please?

451
00:26:02,480 --> 00:26:03,750
Let go!

452
00:26:03,860 --> 00:26:04,860
Just for a minute.

453
00:26:04,880 --> 00:26:06,760
I'll give you a ride to your condo.

454
00:26:09,050 --> 00:26:10,060
I'll give you ten.

455
00:26:10,550 --> 00:26:11,340
Okay,

456
00:26:11,360 --> 00:26:12,090
ten minutes.

457
00:26:12,110 --> 00:26:12,760
Ten...

458
00:26:13,360 --> 00:26:14,480
- Nine...
- Whoa!

459
00:26:14,730 --> 00:26:15,240
Eight...

460
00:26:15,600 --> 00:26:16,280
Seven...

461
00:26:17,310 --> 00:26:17,920
Six...

462
00:26:18,580 --> 00:26:19,910
Five, four, three, two, one, zero.

463
00:26:19,930 --> 00:26:21,200
Wait, hey!

464
00:26:21,220 --> 00:26:22,040
Time's up!

465
00:26:22,880 --> 00:26:23,380
Halt!

466
00:26:23,410 --> 00:26:23,900
Halt!

467
00:26:23,920 --> 00:26:24,860
Halt!!

468
00:26:33,880 --> 00:26:35,360
Pretty please?

469
00:26:38,520 --> 00:26:40,440
Just retake that Animal Exercise class.

470
00:26:40,660 --> 00:26:42,160
Luang's gotta be bawling 'cause of this.

471
00:26:44,150 --> 00:26:44,960
Okay,

472
00:26:47,280 --> 00:26:48,600
I'm getting into the lesson, then.

473
00:27:05,080 --> 00:27:06,260
Don't!

474
00:27:06,280 --> 00:27:07,520
I'm not letting you go...

475
00:27:08,190 --> 00:27:09,880
No...

476
00:27:11,650 --> 00:27:12,440
Come on.

477
00:27:12,560 --> 00:27:13,410
Are you giving me a ride or what?

478
00:27:13,430 --> 00:27:14,200
Let's go. Get up.

479
00:27:20,670 --> 00:27:21,960
Shoot me with the update.

480
00:27:23,670 --> 00:27:27,050
So, right now,
the team and I have agreed that

481
00:27:27,070 --> 00:27:29,570
when it comes to the main cast
of 'Mr. Fanboy Series,'

482
00:27:29,590 --> 00:27:31,830
the two male leads
have to be Third and Wan.

483
00:27:33,350 --> 00:27:33,830
Alright.

484
00:27:33,860 --> 00:27:35,020
We're on the same page.

485
00:27:35,040 --> 00:27:36,700
I finished the novel you wrote, Time,

486
00:27:36,720 --> 00:27:37,760
'Mr. Fanboy,' I mean.

487
00:27:38,150 --> 00:27:39,760
As for the screenwriting team,

488
00:27:39,780 --> 00:27:41,120
they're outlining the dialogue.

489
00:27:42,430 --> 00:27:43,680
Any thoughts? Do you like it?

490
00:27:43,700 --> 00:27:44,720
It was such a fun read.

491
00:27:44,740 --> 00:27:47,320
Wow, the story's timing and
narrative dynamics are awesome.

492
00:27:47,340 --> 00:27:49,170
More than that, it's realistic.

493
00:27:49,190 --> 00:27:50,960
Feels like
it has actual life to it or something.

494
00:27:51,310 --> 00:27:51,790
Oh...

495
00:27:51,810 --> 00:27:53,800
Not just "feels like."

496
00:27:53,820 --> 00:27:54,830
It has actual "lives" to it, alright.

497
00:27:54,850 --> 00:27:56,400
And I can tell who they are.

498
00:27:57,290 --> 00:27:58,660
I tried to twist it.

499
00:27:58,680 --> 00:28:00,310
Like, I tried to change the details.

500
00:28:00,330 --> 00:28:00,990
Still...

501
00:28:01,630 --> 00:28:03,280
it’s too close to reality, right?

502
00:28:03,300 --> 00:28:04,480
- Good call on twisting it.
- You... You did.

503
00:28:04,500 --> 00:28:05,120
- You did?
- If...

504
00:28:05,140 --> 00:28:07,110
If you didn't twist it,
it would've turned into a documentary.

505
00:28:07,130 --> 00:28:08,440
It would've been too realistic, you see.

506
00:28:15,010 --> 00:28:17,040
Jay, you're gonna get it...

507
00:28:17,460 --> 00:28:18,310
You have to make the cut.

508
00:28:18,330 --> 00:28:20,860
If not, where would these even go?

509
00:28:21,990 --> 00:28:24,240
Wan, my guy.

510
00:28:24,260 --> 00:28:25,360
Uh... What's up, my guy?

511
00:28:27,160 --> 00:28:27,870
What are you up to?

512
00:28:27,890 --> 00:28:29,240
Uh, nothing.

513
00:28:30,860 --> 00:28:32,120
So did you make the cut?

514
00:28:32,460 --> 00:28:33,340
I don't know.

515
00:28:33,600 --> 00:28:34,770
Cher hasn't said anything.

516
00:28:34,790 --> 00:28:36,000
What about you? Did you?

517
00:28:39,860 --> 00:28:42,080
I'll take the chicken in gravy.

518
00:28:43,340 --> 00:28:44,760
Don't you worry.

519
00:28:45,060 --> 00:28:46,300
I have it prepared.

520
00:28:46,390 --> 00:28:46,940
So that's mine.

521
00:28:46,960 --> 00:28:47,910
Bam!

522
00:28:47,930 --> 00:28:49,040
Dog food.

523
00:28:49,860 --> 00:28:51,070
Wait, there's more.

524
00:28:51,100 --> 00:28:52,120
Bam!

525
00:28:52,140 --> 00:28:53,170
These are on the house.

526
00:28:53,200 --> 00:28:54,880
Shampoo for when you wanna shower.

527
00:28:54,900 --> 00:28:55,760
There's more.

528
00:28:56,300 --> 00:28:57,440
Perfume spray

529
00:28:57,560 --> 00:28:59,560
so you smell nice and rich.

530
00:28:59,720 --> 00:29:00,630
Take them, take them.

531
00:29:00,650 --> 00:29:02,760
I'm becoming an actor, not a dog!

532
00:29:02,910 --> 00:29:05,000
Please, I'm the bottom male lead's friend!

533
00:29:05,050 --> 00:29:05,740
I know!

534
00:29:06,070 --> 00:29:07,560
And here they are, my good intentions.

535
00:29:07,580 --> 00:29:08,490
Now, his friend's gonna smell nice

536
00:29:08,510 --> 00:29:09,680
- and divine. Take it.
- No way!

537
00:29:09,700 --> 00:29:11,880
- Here you go.
- This is all I've promised, so this is it!

538
00:29:14,620 --> 00:29:15,460
What's going on?

539
00:29:15,480 --> 00:29:17,290
- It's Jay!
- No. Nothing at all.

540
00:29:17,310 --> 00:29:18,290
Just had a meal,

541
00:29:18,310 --> 00:29:19,760
and I'm all bloated. Look.

542
00:29:21,380 --> 00:29:22,050
Wan,

543
00:29:22,070 --> 00:29:23,730
the series' account hinted
they already cast the roles.

544
00:29:23,750 --> 00:29:24,580
Did you get the role?

545
00:29:25,400 --> 00:29:26,010
[From a novel based on the true story
of a set's behind-the-scenes

546
00:29:26,030 --> 00:29:26,720
to 'Mr. Fanboy Series,'

547
00:29:26,740 --> 00:29:27,350
coming soon]

548
00:29:27,370 --> 00:29:28,470
Did you make the cut?

549
00:29:29,370 --> 00:29:30,370
I don't know.

550
00:29:30,750 --> 00:29:31,750
But...

551
00:29:32,150 --> 00:29:33,340
Jay made the cut!

552
00:29:33,360 --> 00:29:35,260
Whoa, really?!

553
00:29:35,640 --> 00:29:36,820
Jeez...

554
00:29:36,840 --> 00:29:39,580
Wanna go ahead
and ask for my autograph, sis?

555
00:29:41,450 --> 00:29:42,560
I wanna know about yours.

556
00:29:43,010 --> 00:29:44,050
Call Cher.

557
00:29:45,500 --> 00:29:46,310
Quick.

558
00:29:51,560 --> 00:29:52,640
Hello, girlie.

559
00:29:52,660 --> 00:29:54,660
What's up, girlie?

560
00:29:55,450 --> 00:29:55,910
So...

561
00:29:55,940 --> 00:29:57,570
the voices in my head took the W.

562
00:29:57,590 --> 00:29:58,720
Did Wan make the cut?

563
00:30:01,000 --> 00:30:04,000
Wait, what do those laughs mean, girlie?

564
00:30:06,670 --> 00:30:08,070
Tell Wan

565
00:30:08,190 --> 00:30:10,160
that we're meeting
the producers tomorrow

566
00:30:10,240 --> 00:30:12,680
- because he made the cut!
- Whoa!

567
00:30:15,270 --> 00:30:16,760
See you tomorrow at 8 A.M.

568
00:30:16,780 --> 00:30:17,930
I'll pick you up at your condo, Wan.

569
00:30:17,950 --> 00:30:18,450
Alright,

570
00:30:18,470 --> 00:30:19,720
sure thing, Cher.

571
00:30:23,450 --> 00:30:24,880
That's what I'm talking about!

572
00:30:26,060 --> 00:30:26,970
Isn't that right?

573
00:30:26,990 --> 00:30:30,920
Cause this is the place
where every dream comes true!

574
00:30:31,820 --> 00:30:34,130
- Yay!
- Yay!

575
00:30:34,280 --> 00:30:35,240
Attaboy.

576
00:30:35,950 --> 00:30:38,240
I pray that no trouble
comes your way this time.

577
00:30:38,260 --> 00:30:39,830
May you find yourself a nice crowd

578
00:30:39,850 --> 00:30:42,200
and become a global star, brother!

579
00:30:42,850 --> 00:30:44,950
- Sadhu!
- Sadhu!

580
00:30:46,060 --> 00:30:47,180
Hey, what about you, Jay?

581
00:30:47,200 --> 00:30:47,870
Huh?

582
00:30:48,740 --> 00:30:50,260
- What?
- You!

583
00:30:50,750 --> 00:30:51,960
He's gonna eat dog food!

584
00:30:51,980 --> 00:30:52,780
I'm not...

585
00:30:52,800 --> 00:30:53,400
You're right!

586
00:30:53,420 --> 00:30:55,730
- I'm just bloated after a meal.
- See? Look at that.

587
00:30:55,750 --> 00:30:57,330
I have to take a shit.

588
00:30:57,640 --> 00:30:59,000
Can I take a shit first?

589
00:31:03,290 --> 00:31:04,880
Congratulations, Wan.

590
00:31:05,420 --> 00:31:07,740
In the end, you did it.

591
00:31:07,760 --> 00:31:09,520
You finally made it through.

592
00:31:09,580 --> 00:31:10,840
Amazing job!

593
00:31:12,950 --> 00:31:16,510
Well, thank you for giving me a chance.

594
00:31:17,750 --> 00:31:19,000
You too, Cher.

595
00:31:23,490 --> 00:31:24,360
Though, I do think

596
00:31:24,380 --> 00:31:26,480
I have it in me
to become the company's legend?

597
00:31:26,640 --> 00:31:27,860
You are a legend, alright.

598
00:31:28,260 --> 00:31:29,080
Wut and I

599
00:31:29,100 --> 00:31:30,960
were balding so bad
we almost lost all our hair.

600
00:31:31,610 --> 00:31:32,720
I have gray hair, too.

601
00:31:33,170 --> 00:31:35,280
I used up a whole carton
of box dyes to cover it up.

602
00:31:36,840 --> 00:31:38,430
Um...

603
00:31:39,020 --> 00:31:41,600
So, if I want to work here again,

604
00:31:41,730 --> 00:31:44,040
I'm not sure about the documents...

605
00:31:45,060 --> 00:31:47,840
You mean
the Termination of Artist Contract?

606
00:31:48,450 --> 00:31:49,260
Ugh!

607
00:31:49,280 --> 00:31:52,640
I fed that paper to the goats ages ago

608
00:31:55,060 --> 00:31:56,690
cause I always knew...

609
00:31:56,710 --> 00:31:59,700
you'd come back no matter what.

610
00:32:00,250 --> 00:32:02,160
Well, I'm sure that...

611
00:32:02,420 --> 00:32:03,230
this house

612
00:32:03,250 --> 00:32:05,110
will make every dream

613
00:32:05,130 --> 00:32:07,240
come true!

614
00:32:10,440 --> 00:32:11,180
Oh, goodness!

615
00:32:11,910 --> 00:32:12,570
The tears...

616
00:32:12,590 --> 00:32:14,020
Ugh, goodness. Give me a hug!

617
00:32:14,040 --> 00:32:15,550
Alright, bring it in.

618
00:32:15,790 --> 00:32:17,840
I'm so proud of my baby!

619
00:32:18,950 --> 00:32:20,450
Cher, quick. Join our group hug.

620
00:32:24,430 --> 00:32:27,230
Our butts are saved.
No more shutting this place down!

621
00:32:27,250 --> 00:32:29,360
Uh... if that’s the case,

622
00:32:30,030 --> 00:32:31,820
don't forget to pay me back 10,000 baht.

623
00:32:33,200 --> 00:32:33,800
What was that for?

624
00:32:33,940 --> 00:32:34,660
Well...

625
00:32:34,790 --> 00:32:36,720
For taking Wan to the audition.

626
00:32:38,030 --> 00:32:40,280
Ah, I remember it now.

627
00:32:40,300 --> 00:32:41,000
Uh, wait.

628
00:32:41,140 --> 00:32:42,240
It's actually 15,000.

629
00:32:42,260 --> 00:32:43,480
15,000 baht.

630
00:32:43,650 --> 00:32:44,800
Where's the other 5,000 from?

631
00:32:44,950 --> 00:32:46,780
The first audition
for 'The Deep Between Us.'

632
00:32:48,440 --> 00:32:49,350
Smart!

633
00:32:49,630 --> 00:32:51,930
Excellent memory, indeed.

634
00:32:51,950 --> 00:32:55,250
So how come you always
fumble the schedules so terribly?

635
00:32:56,010 --> 00:32:57,430
Well, the schedules are packed

636
00:32:57,450 --> 00:32:58,720
but I don't get paid enough.

637
00:32:59,750 --> 00:33:00,860
Fine, I'll wire it to you.

638
00:33:02,140 --> 00:33:04,220
And hurry up and take Wan upstairs.

639
00:33:04,240 --> 00:33:06,420
I've told the team to prepare everything.

640
00:33:06,440 --> 00:33:08,100
You know what you have to do, right?

641
00:33:08,750 --> 00:33:11,560
It's the Star Glamour time!

642
00:33:12,170 --> 00:33:13,030
Oops, I'm mistaken.

643
00:33:13,050 --> 00:33:14,600
For you, it has to be

644
00:33:14,710 --> 00:33:18,720
the Star Glamour time, "once again"!

645
00:33:21,290 --> 00:33:23,140
Reborn. Rebirth.

646
00:33:23,160 --> 00:33:23,850
Right on.

647
00:33:23,870 --> 00:33:24,640
You're free today, right?

648
00:33:24,660 --> 00:33:25,980
There's so much to be done,

649
00:33:26,000 --> 00:33:27,540
but first things first...

650
00:33:27,580 --> 00:33:28,520
Taking headshots.

651
00:33:29,270 --> 00:33:30,040
Excellent.

652
00:33:30,240 --> 00:33:31,040
- Let's go.
- Let's go.

653
00:33:31,060 --> 00:33:32,430
Fabulous. Make sure you rock it.

654
00:33:32,450 --> 00:33:32,960
Alright.

655
00:33:32,980 --> 00:33:33,650
Oh?

656
00:33:37,060 --> 00:33:38,060
Hello, Cher.

657
00:33:38,080 --> 00:33:39,120
Hello, Wut.

658
00:33:39,350 --> 00:33:40,550
Hello, Wan.

659
00:33:40,570 --> 00:33:41,530
Hello.

660
00:33:41,550 --> 00:33:42,500
This is Pung,

661
00:33:42,520 --> 00:33:44,720
the brand-new kid on the block.

662
00:33:45,530 --> 00:33:46,480
Uh, Wan,

663
00:33:46,540 --> 00:33:48,900
I've always been a fan of your work.

664
00:33:49,140 --> 00:33:50,600
I'm so glad you're back.

665
00:33:51,920 --> 00:33:53,430
Right, you're now the senior.

666
00:33:53,450 --> 00:33:55,000
Hype him up a little.

667
00:33:58,690 --> 00:33:59,520
Is that a good idea?

668
00:33:59,960 --> 00:34:02,840
Come on, it's like
how that senior hyped you up.

669
00:34:03,100 --> 00:34:04,440
Go on.

670
00:34:15,880 --> 00:34:16,929
Good luck, boy.

671
00:34:17,469 --> 00:34:19,260
One day, you'll be as famous as me.

672
00:34:19,290 --> 00:34:22,610
So famous that
you wanna flee from the industry!

673
00:34:25,400 --> 00:34:27,010
A big-name superstar.

674
00:34:29,889 --> 00:34:32,000
Wow! Global kind of vibe.

675
00:34:34,270 --> 00:34:35,320
Let's go, Cher.

676
00:34:35,989 --> 00:34:37,280
Perfect.

677
00:34:37,530 --> 00:34:38,719
You really copy-pasted the guy.

678
00:34:38,739 --> 00:34:40,320
Keep a close eye on him, Cher.

679
00:34:40,670 --> 00:34:41,730
Alright, Kendall.

680
00:34:41,750 --> 00:34:42,840
Go trim your bangs.

681
00:34:42,889 --> 00:34:43,900
They're not even.

682
00:34:44,360 --> 00:34:45,219
Please.

683
00:34:45,239 --> 00:34:46,120
Thank you.

684
00:34:51,239 --> 00:34:52,340
Your name is Pung, right?

685
00:34:52,360 --> 00:34:53,230
That's right.

686
00:34:53,250 --> 00:34:54,639
Welcome.

687
00:34:54,940 --> 00:34:56,500
You've made the right decision

688
00:34:56,520 --> 00:34:57,960
signing with us

689
00:34:58,530 --> 00:35:00,080
because this place

690
00:35:00,160 --> 00:35:02,360
makes every dream

691
00:35:02,710 --> 00:35:05,920
come true!

692
00:35:09,260 --> 00:35:10,020
Isn't it cute?

693
00:35:10,040 --> 00:35:11,690
- It is.
- Come on. Give it a try.

694
00:35:11,710 --> 00:35:13,750
"This place makes every dream

695
00:35:13,770 --> 00:35:15,460
come true!"

696
00:35:15,480 --> 00:35:17,370
Add more flow to it.

697
00:35:17,390 --> 00:35:18,600
Go with the tide.

698
00:35:18,690 --> 00:35:20,430
"This place makes every dream

699
00:35:20,450 --> 00:35:22,300
come true!"

700
00:35:22,320 --> 00:35:24,000
Wow, superb hand movement.

701
00:35:24,050 --> 00:35:26,250
- Trust me. You're starting off with a bang.
- Right.

702
00:35:26,270 --> 00:35:28,880
- Thank you.
- Okay!

703
00:35:31,860 --> 00:35:33,240
Let's get down to business.

704
00:35:33,580 --> 00:35:35,210
I invited you all here today

705
00:35:35,230 --> 00:35:38,120
to prepare to announce
the shooting of 'Mr. Fanboy Series.'

706
00:35:38,380 --> 00:35:40,100
Our leading men are

707
00:35:40,120 --> 00:35:41,120
Third and Wan.

708
00:35:41,940 --> 00:35:43,240
At this year's lineup event,

709
00:35:43,260 --> 00:35:44,830
we'll introduce both of you.

710
00:35:45,020 --> 00:35:46,930
Casting a real-life couple like this...

711
00:35:47,690 --> 00:35:48,800
it's gonna go viral.

712
00:35:50,230 --> 00:35:52,150
I'm sorry, Third, Wan,

713
00:35:52,170 --> 00:35:55,000
for adapting your story
into a novel without asking.

714
00:35:56,040 --> 00:35:56,920
You're fine.

715
00:35:57,130 --> 00:35:58,480
But I agree with this

716
00:35:58,670 --> 00:36:01,680
because ThirdWan's chemistry
is through the roof.

717
00:36:02,430 --> 00:36:03,120
Look,

718
00:36:04,240 --> 00:36:06,080
just their eye contact alone...

719
00:36:23,370 --> 00:36:24,900
Then, I'm gonna go ahead and confess.

720
00:36:25,720 --> 00:36:27,240
When they were on camera,

721
00:36:27,490 --> 00:36:29,800
I was secretly squealing
during their scenes together!

722
00:36:30,750 --> 00:36:32,280
The gassing up isn't personal, right?

723
00:36:32,560 --> 00:36:34,000
Not at all, Wut.

724
00:36:34,130 --> 00:36:36,850
At first, their chemistry
was that of a ghost ship.

725
00:36:36,870 --> 00:36:39,230
But now, they're real.

726
00:36:39,250 --> 00:36:39,840
Ugh!

727
00:36:39,980 --> 00:36:41,740
The shippers are about to be brain-rotted!

728
00:36:42,560 --> 00:36:44,160
The brain rot, the brain rot...

729
00:36:44,660 --> 00:36:46,080
Don't get carried away with the teasing.

730
00:36:46,150 --> 00:36:47,620
If Wan decides against the role,

731
00:36:47,640 --> 00:36:49,240
I'm blaming you two.

732
00:36:50,080 --> 00:36:50,800
Good.

733
00:36:51,380 --> 00:36:52,820
Reject the role,

734
00:36:53,030 --> 00:36:54,880
and I'll launch a new couple.

735
00:36:55,640 --> 00:36:56,760
How does ThirdWut sound?

736
00:36:59,630 --> 00:37:00,440
That's not it.

737
00:37:11,550 --> 00:37:14,380
There's still no email response

738
00:37:14,620 --> 00:37:16,220
from previous auditions.

739
00:37:17,270 --> 00:37:18,120
But tomorrow,

740
00:37:18,640 --> 00:37:22,000
you're going to an audition at
'Space Station Casting Studios.'

741
00:37:23,220 --> 00:37:24,910
Also, you have an appointment
with your psychiatrist.

742
00:37:29,650 --> 00:37:30,440
Nine?

743
00:37:32,000 --> 00:37:32,710
Yes, Mama?

744
00:37:32,820 --> 00:37:34,490
You were listening, right?

745
00:37:37,310 --> 00:37:38,020
Okay.

746
00:37:39,340 --> 00:37:40,140
Let's head out.

747
00:37:41,770 --> 00:37:42,390
Come on.

748
00:38:09,500 --> 00:38:10,660
Hi...

749
00:38:14,230 --> 00:38:15,120
Hi...

750
00:38:43,110 --> 00:38:44,930
Finally, we can watch this together.

751
00:38:47,770 --> 00:38:48,780
Mm.

752
00:38:48,960 --> 00:38:51,400
So many ways to interpret it
now that we're watching it again, huh?

753
00:38:53,780 --> 00:38:54,890
As you mature,

754
00:38:54,910 --> 00:38:56,210
your mindset changes.

755
00:38:58,120 --> 00:39:00,000
Though my feelings for you

756
00:39:00,170 --> 00:39:01,880
never change!

757
00:39:06,510 --> 00:39:07,800
So delusional.

758
00:39:10,330 --> 00:39:12,320
Do you like it, though? Hm?

759
00:39:23,010 --> 00:39:26,200
♫Just a gentle, gentle gaze♫

760
00:39:26,220 --> 00:39:27,520
♫On me, on me♫

761
00:39:27,540 --> 00:39:29,660
♫Keep your eyes on me♫

762
00:39:29,680 --> 00:39:30,560
I'm hungry.

763
00:39:35,130 --> 00:39:36,220
What should we eat?

764
00:39:36,840 --> 00:39:38,180
Leave it to your chef.

765
00:39:38,370 --> 00:39:41,000
♫Keep your eyes on me♫

766
00:39:41,020 --> 00:39:43,380
♫On me, on me♫

767
00:39:45,730 --> 00:39:48,020
What should we eat?

768
00:39:52,440 --> 00:39:53,440
How about KFC?

769
00:39:54,150 --> 00:39:54,860
Good idea.

770
00:39:56,050 --> 00:39:56,810
When I was little,

771
00:39:56,830 --> 00:39:58,410
I wanted to be the colonel so much.

772
00:40:03,170 --> 00:40:04,720
Stop being so delusional...

773
00:40:06,140 --> 00:40:07,140
Don't you like it?

774
00:40:11,510 --> 00:40:12,560
Just go place an order.

775
00:40:20,100 --> 00:40:22,240
Here, I'm gonna take
these two pieces, right?

776
00:40:22,650 --> 00:40:23,840
And this.

777
00:40:24,050 --> 00:40:25,280
- Looks yummy.
- One.

778
00:40:32,350 --> 00:40:32,950
Here.

779
00:40:38,640 --> 00:40:39,720
What did you do?

780
00:40:39,930 --> 00:40:41,520
I made you a heart.

781
00:40:42,580 --> 00:40:44,050
Wholeheartedly delicious.

782
00:40:44,440 --> 00:40:45,680
Enjoy your food!

783
00:40:47,640 --> 00:40:48,760
It doesn't look like a heart.

784
00:40:49,620 --> 00:40:51,190
That’s because you can't
design how love turns out.

785
00:40:55,950 --> 00:40:56,770
Wait!

786
00:40:58,040 --> 00:41:01,600
I'm gonna show you how to eat
and make the client choose you.

787
00:41:03,190 --> 00:41:03,840
How?

788
00:41:03,860 --> 00:41:05,340
Like this!

789
00:41:08,270 --> 00:41:09,200
Hm!

790
00:41:09,610 --> 00:41:10,660
Try it.

791
00:41:11,470 --> 00:41:12,570
Mm!

792
00:41:13,780 --> 00:41:14,640
Adorable.

793
00:41:15,040 --> 00:41:16,080
The chicken nuggets are.

794
00:41:16,360 --> 00:41:17,520
So are you.

795
00:41:22,920 --> 00:41:24,250
If I were the client,

796
00:41:24,450 --> 00:41:26,440
I'd choose you as
my brand representative for sure.

797
00:41:29,270 --> 00:41:31,120
Let me trouble you with it, then,
Mr. Client.

798
00:41:56,050 --> 00:41:57,250
Mm!

799
00:42:05,720 --> 00:42:07,080
[Screenplay: Episode 1]

800
00:42:11,690 --> 00:42:13,470
Isn't Time too observant?

801
00:42:14,310 --> 00:42:15,770
I don't even know about some things.

802
00:42:17,990 --> 00:42:19,520
It's the writer's spirit.

803
00:42:19,930 --> 00:42:21,480
We just don't realize it.

804
00:42:22,230 --> 00:42:23,000
That's true.

805
00:42:24,000 --> 00:42:25,770
The storytelling is so much fun, though.

806
00:42:27,130 --> 00:42:29,780
The leads are also adorable, but...

807
00:42:30,170 --> 00:42:31,920
I don't think we're that adorable?

808
00:42:32,090 --> 00:42:33,460
We're probably even more adorable.

809
00:42:34,290 --> 00:42:35,720
You just don't realize it.

810
00:42:37,790 --> 00:42:39,520
Don't try to flirt.

811
00:42:39,900 --> 00:42:41,800
You can't charm me, Third.

812
00:42:50,990 --> 00:42:52,320
Aren't you guys too lovey-dovey?

813
00:42:56,930 --> 00:42:58,200
We'll sit properly.

814
00:42:58,880 --> 00:43:00,080
I don't mind.

815
00:43:00,100 --> 00:43:01,510
Sit wherever you want.

816
00:43:01,540 --> 00:43:03,800
As long as your relationship
doesn't ruin the work.

817
00:43:06,820 --> 00:43:07,500
You mean it?

818
00:43:07,520 --> 00:43:08,400
Mm.

819
00:43:13,580 --> 00:43:16,880
You need to be
considerate of other people, though.

820
00:43:17,210 --> 00:43:19,120
This is gonna rot my brain.

821
00:43:24,000 --> 00:43:26,000
Hey, get down and sit properly, Wan!

822
00:43:27,110 --> 00:43:29,040
If Wut comes in, we're all doomed.

823
00:43:29,360 --> 00:43:30,040
I'm not scared.

824
00:43:30,110 --> 00:43:31,130
I fucking am.

825
00:43:32,430 --> 00:43:33,500
If I lose my job,

826
00:43:33,520 --> 00:43:34,840
no one's gonna manage Wan.

827
00:43:39,020 --> 00:43:39,680
Read your script.

828
00:43:39,700 --> 00:43:41,160
Chop-chop. Get it over with.

829
00:43:42,130 --> 00:43:43,680
You have 11 episodes left.

830
00:44:08,640 --> 00:44:09,320
Hey,

831
00:44:09,650 --> 00:44:11,280
when are you free these days?

832
00:44:12,870 --> 00:44:14,640
I'm kinda free. Why?

833
00:44:17,200 --> 00:44:18,560
My mom wants to meet you.

834
00:44:18,920 --> 00:44:19,550
Huh?

835
00:44:20,320 --> 00:44:21,200
Seriously?

836
00:44:21,370 --> 00:44:22,000
Mm,

837
00:44:22,550 --> 00:44:24,760
she told me to bring you to see her.

838
00:44:25,340 --> 00:44:26,530
I already told my mom

839
00:44:27,330 --> 00:44:28,520
that you're my boyfriend.

840
00:44:31,520 --> 00:44:32,520
Whoa,

841
00:44:33,770 --> 00:44:35,400
I haven't even said yes.

842
00:44:35,770 --> 00:44:36,630
